1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,046
Over the mountains and through the valleys

2
00:00:05,407 --> 00:00:08,613
Like an airplane, the ninja flies freely in the sky

3
00:00:08,865 --> 00:00:12,298
Honest and kind, Hattori is loved by all

4
00:00:12,452 --> 00:00:15,632
With eyes wide open and lips pressed tight

5
00:00:15,965 --> 00:00:19,366
Hiding his face with cheeks puffed out

6
00:00:19,532 --> 00:00:22,690
Catching villains with lightning-fast agility

7
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:26,457
Catching bad guys with wacky tricks like magic

8
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:29,836
Speaking like poetry, so polite and spirited

9
00:00:31,913 --> 00:00:34,033
"Kenichi Flies in the Sky"

10
00:00:40,121 --> 00:00:41,231
It's ready

11
00:00:41,272 --> 00:00:43,488
Just put the rubber bands on and it's all done

12
00:00:43,529 --> 00:00:46,048
Hey, Shishimaru, have you seen the rubber bands?

13
00:00:46,088 --> 00:00:47,900
No, I haven't seen them

14
00:00:48,472 --> 00:00:51,818
Oh no, how can a plane take off without rubber bands?

15
00:00:52,048 --> 00:00:53,172
What should I do?

16
00:00:57,067 --> 00:00:58,190
What is it, Shishimaru?

17
00:01:06,770 --> 00:01:09,000
Isn't the plane taking off yet?

18
00:01:09,084 --> 00:01:10,593
No rush, take your time

19
00:01:10,671 --> 00:01:13,539
This is great, I love model airplanes!

20
00:01:14,149 --> 00:01:16,397
Alright, I'm launching it!

21
00:01:16,490 --> 00:01:18,076
It's flying!

22
00:01:18,249 --> 00:01:20,017
Awesome...

23
00:01:20,296 --> 00:01:21,129
Awesome!

24
00:01:21,404 --> 00:01:23,224
-Kenichi, that's awesome!
-Way to go, Kenichi!

25
00:01:23,407 --> 00:01:24,860
It's alright

26
00:01:25,939 --> 00:01:27,808
I didn't think Kenichi knew how to build a plane

27
00:01:27,848 --> 00:01:29,283
Kemumaki, is that you?

28
00:01:29,416 --> 00:01:30,994
I don't know how to build model planes

29
00:01:31,035 --> 00:01:32,848
So I just had to buy one with money

30
00:01:33,001 --> 00:01:34,259
Fifty thousand yen!

31
00:01:34,492 --> 00:01:36,028
What on earth is it?

32
00:01:38,196 --> 00:01:40,083
Wow, it's radio-controlled!

33
00:01:41,270 --> 00:01:42,543
This is so much fun!

34
00:01:42,584 --> 00:01:44,230
Yumeko, why don't you have a try?

35
00:01:45,042 --> 00:01:46,513
Will I know how to fly it?

36
00:01:46,547 --> 00:01:48,676
Come on, I can teach you

37
00:01:50,125 --> 00:01:52,138
Oh no...

38
00:01:52,882 --> 00:01:54,367
Kenichi, I'm so sorry!

39
00:01:54,408 --> 00:01:57,298
If you don't stay focused, it's easy to crash

40
00:01:57,516 --> 00:01:58,971
Look out!

41
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:04,317
Nice! Yumeko is doing pretty well

42
00:02:04,357 --> 00:02:05,666
Really?

43
00:02:11,510 --> 00:02:12,473
Absolutely not

44
00:02:12,519 --> 00:02:14,804
Our family can't afford a remote-controlled plane

45
00:02:14,878 --> 00:02:16,785
Mom, please, just this once!

46
00:02:16,826 --> 00:02:18,510
I promise I'll listen to everything you say from now on

47
00:02:18,550 --> 00:02:20,110
I'll even help you with the housework

48
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:21,114
I said no

49
00:02:21,154 --> 00:02:22,389
You already have a model plane to play with

50
00:02:22,429 --> 00:02:23,682
Don't waste any more money

51
00:02:23,868 --> 00:02:25,640
What's going on, dear?

52
00:02:25,807 --> 00:02:28,521
That little troublemaker Kenichi actually wants to buy a remote-controlled plane

53
00:02:29,211 --> 00:02:30,551
Then let's just buy it for him

54
00:02:30,697 --> 00:02:32,683
Yay, Dad is the best!

55
00:02:32,724 --> 00:02:34,420
Dad, it's a remote-controlled plane!

56
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:35,544
A remote-controlled plane?

57
00:02:35,697 --> 00:02:37,056
Each one costs tens of thousands of yen

58
00:02:37,097 --> 00:02:38,263
Why is it so expensive?

59
00:02:38,304 --> 00:02:39,958
You've got to be kidding me, Kenichi

60
00:02:39,999 --> 00:02:41,397
Didn't you even stop to think?

61
00:02:41,573 --> 00:02:43,050
Fine, don't buy it then!

62
00:02:43,398 --> 00:02:44,914
Wait, Kenichi!

63
00:02:44,955 --> 00:02:46,658
Hmph, so stingy

64
00:02:47,577 --> 00:02:48,552
Yumeko

65
00:02:48,592 --> 00:02:51,185
Kenichi, why did you run off all of a sudden?

66
00:02:51,225 --> 00:02:53,289
Kemumaki says he's sorry

67
00:02:54,471 --> 00:02:57,315
He wants to invite you to play with his RC plane

68
00:02:57,592 --> 00:02:59,239
No way, what's so fun about that?

69
00:02:59,285 --> 00:03:00,500
Just you watch, I'm going to make a plane

70
00:03:00,540 --> 00:03:02,155
dozens of times bigger than his

71
00:03:02,457 --> 00:03:03,396
Dozens of times bigger?

72
00:03:03,437 --> 00:03:04,885
It can even carry people!

73
00:03:05,122 --> 00:03:06,611
A plane that can carry people?

74
00:03:06,651 --> 00:03:08,093
You tell Kemumaki

75
00:03:08,140 --> 00:03:10,339
his RC plane is total child's play

76
00:03:12,887 --> 00:03:14,357
Help me out, Hattori-kun

77
00:03:14,397 --> 00:03:15,942
Use your magic to conjure up a plane

78
00:03:15,982 --> 00:03:17,119
that can carry people

79
00:03:17,159 --> 00:03:19,761
Kenichi, I've told you many times

80
00:03:19,801 --> 00:03:21,469
Ninjutsu isn't magical sorcery

81
00:03:21,509 --> 00:03:22,828
It doesn't grant every wish

82
00:03:22,869 --> 00:03:24,709
Please think of something

83
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:31,363
It's actually very simple

84
00:03:31,404 --> 00:03:33,811
As long as you sit on it, it can fly

85
00:03:33,858 --> 00:03:34,702
However...

86
00:03:34,742 --> 00:03:37,404
I'm worried you don't have enough leg power to get it moving

87
00:03:37,445 --> 00:03:38,140
Alright

88
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:40,408
Starting tomorrow, I'll train my leg power

89
00:03:40,448 --> 00:03:42,043
We're starting tonight!

90
00:03:42,083 --> 00:03:44,652
One, two...

91
00:03:44,692 --> 00:03:48,506
- One, two...
- One, two...

92
00:03:48,547 --> 00:03:51,900
I have to prove myself, I've got to work hard

93
00:03:57,726 --> 00:03:59,547
We have to practice in the morning too

94
00:03:59,653 --> 00:04:02,490
Kenichi, hurry up and get up for running practice

95
00:04:02,539 --> 00:04:03,820
Yan...

96
00:04:04,491 --> 00:04:05,446
Hattori-kun

97
00:04:05,646 --> 00:04:08,066
Kenichi really is determined

98
00:04:09,244 --> 00:04:12,598
- One, two...
- Yan...

99
00:04:12,765 --> 00:04:15,523
One, two...

100
00:04:15,564 --> 00:04:17,997
Yan... Training every single day

101
00:04:18,948 --> 00:04:22,361
- One, two...
- Yan...

102
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:24,552
You have to work hard

103
00:04:24,592 --> 00:04:26,595
You need to show it off in front of Yumeko

104
00:04:26,635 --> 00:04:28,372
Okay, I'll do my best!

105
00:04:37,782 --> 00:04:38,726
Fly!

106
00:04:40,345 --> 00:04:43,268
Fly... Hurry up and fly, fly!

107
00:04:43,308 --> 00:04:45,852
Keep going, put your back into it!

108
00:04:57,118 --> 00:04:59,418
Why can't I get it off the ground no matter how hard I try?

109
00:05:07,905 --> 00:05:09,021
Oh dear, Shinzo

110
00:05:09,061 --> 00:05:11,397
Please stop crying!

111
00:05:13,752 --> 00:05:16,242
Alright, Shinzo, are you done crying now?

112
00:05:16,549 --> 00:05:17,947
I have an idea

113
00:05:18,888 --> 00:05:20,740
Big Brother, will it really work?

114
00:05:20,780 --> 00:05:22,254
Try crying

115
00:05:22,694 --> 00:05:24,286
Think of something sad

116
00:05:24,326 --> 00:05:26,347
and have a good, hard cry

117
00:05:27,216 --> 00:05:29,655
I can't think of anything sad, how am I supposed to cry?

118
00:05:29,695 --> 00:05:32,333
Think about how you've been away from Mom and Dad for so long

119
00:05:32,373 --> 00:05:34,292
You must feel so lonely and all alone

120
00:05:34,332 --> 00:05:37,428
With you by my side, Big Brother, I'm not lonely at all

121
00:05:37,549 --> 00:05:39,662
Then I have no choice, I have to hit you

122
00:05:39,703 --> 00:05:40,522
Ow!

123
00:05:41,555 --> 00:05:42,746
Are you serious?

124
00:05:42,786 --> 00:05:44,922
Hattori-kun, how could you hit someone for no reason?

125
00:05:44,963 --> 00:05:47,332
I have my reasons

126
00:05:48,725 --> 00:05:51,835
Shinzo is so pitiful, being bullied by his brother like that

127
00:05:51,876 --> 00:05:55,271
Yumeko, you're so good to me

128
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:02,165
Ah, he's flying straight up!

129
00:06:03,831 --> 00:06:05,185
Wow, awesome!

130
00:06:05,439 --> 00:06:07,398
He's flying! Awesome, truly awesome!

131
00:06:07,444 --> 00:06:08,511
It worked!

132
00:06:08,651 --> 00:06:10,700
Shinzo, cry louder!

133
00:06:10,741 --> 00:06:13,776
Ah, Hattori-kun!

134
00:06:14,097 --> 00:06:15,831
What is it?

135
00:06:16,037 --> 00:06:19,003
I've flown way up high, but how do I land?

136
00:06:19,051 --> 00:06:20,292
Oh no, this is bad

137
00:06:20,332 --> 00:06:22,116
I only thought about how to take off

138
00:06:22,157 --> 00:06:24,715
I never considered how to make him land

139
00:06:24,756 --> 00:06:26,479
We're in trouble!

140
00:06:29,334 --> 00:06:31,521
"The Ninja's Super Hearing"

141
00:06:34,347 --> 00:06:36,622
When he finished circling the globe

142
00:06:36,662 --> 00:06:38,894
and was preparing to return to his hometown...

143
00:06:41,298 --> 00:06:43,986
When you jump, you have to push hard with both hands

144
00:06:44,026 --> 00:06:45,489
If you don't jump well, you'll crash

145
00:06:45,529 --> 00:06:47,252
Just like your teacher did

146
00:06:49,026 --> 00:06:51,229
Ah, why is their class so funny?

147
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:53,806
All those sailors were standing on the deck...

148
00:06:55,828 --> 00:06:57,016
Kenichi Mitsuba

149
00:06:57,196 --> 00:06:58,866
If I could hear what they're saying

150
00:06:58,907 --> 00:07:00,703
it would definitely be hilarious

151
00:07:01,710 --> 00:07:02,856
Kenichi Mitsuba!

152
00:07:02,896 --> 00:07:04,092
Ow...

153
00:07:04,133 --> 00:07:06,813
What's wrong with you? Are you deaf?

154
00:07:17,381 --> 00:07:19,281
What are you looking at?

155
00:07:22,693 --> 00:07:24,790
Ugh, they're whispering and laughing out loud

156
00:07:24,831 --> 00:07:27,046
They're really ticking me off! The nerve of them!

157
00:07:27,590 --> 00:07:29,992
Could the two of them be laughing at me?

158
00:07:30,033 --> 00:07:31,605
They're really driving me crazy!

159
00:07:31,713 --> 00:07:33,820
Look, now it turned into a little piggy

160
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:36,139
Yeah, it's so cute!

161
00:07:37,881 --> 00:07:40,128
Why do they keep looking at me and laughing?

162
00:07:40,614 --> 00:07:43,706
Wouldn't it be great if I had super hearing?

163
00:07:43,978 --> 00:07:45,925
Here, Hattori-kun, thank you so much

164
00:07:45,966 --> 00:07:47,742
All right, Mom, I'll be right back

165
00:07:48,016 --> 00:07:50,264
Kenichi, you should really learn from Hattori-kun

166
00:07:50,305 --> 00:07:52,392
and help out with chores around the house more

167
00:07:53,496 --> 00:07:54,312
Oh no, darn it

168
00:07:54,353 --> 00:07:56,538
I forgot to ask him to pick up some fish on the way

169
00:07:56,578 --> 00:07:59,080
Hattori-kun, Hattori-kun!

170
00:07:59,173 --> 00:08:00,667
Yan...

171
00:08:01,399 --> 00:08:04,348
Yan...

172
00:08:05,013 --> 00:08:07,007
Mom, you asked me to pick up fish

173
00:08:07,047 --> 00:08:08,132
What kind of fish should I buy?

174
00:08:08,172 --> 00:08:09,628
You could hear me?

175
00:08:09,940 --> 00:08:11,056
Incredible!

176
00:08:12,432 --> 00:08:15,809
So ninjas can hear sounds
from faraway places?

177
00:08:16,182 --> 00:08:19,050
I can't hear as far as my brother, but still farther than you

178
00:08:19,090 --> 00:08:20,221
Me too!

179
00:08:23,523 --> 00:08:24,667
You have to remember

180
00:08:24,707 --> 00:08:26,842
the further away you get, the more you have to train yourself

181
00:08:26,882 --> 00:08:29,481
To train your ears to hear that bell ringing

182
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:32,340
Let's begin. Yan...

183
00:08:33,222 --> 00:08:35,256
- I can hear it
- Me too!

184
00:08:35,429 --> 00:08:37,196
Yan...

185
00:08:37,412 --> 00:08:39,009
Yan...

186
00:08:41,992 --> 00:08:43,394
I can still hear it now

187
00:08:43,434 --> 00:08:44,196
Me too!

188
00:08:44,236 --> 00:08:45,838
I can hear it too

189
00:08:46,379 --> 00:08:48,117
Yan...

190
00:08:49,638 --> 00:08:51,248
I can hear it very clearly

191
00:08:51,288 --> 00:08:52,225
Me too

192
00:08:56,682 --> 00:09:00,329
Big Brother is so close, anyone could hear that!

193
00:09:00,472 --> 00:09:01,615
I can hear it too

194
00:09:01,749 --> 00:09:02,526
It's no use

195
00:09:02,567 --> 00:09:05,134
No matter how hard I concentrate, I can't hear it

196
00:09:05,754 --> 00:09:07,560
I don't want you to train me slowly

197
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,761
Because that's such a waste of time

198
00:09:08,801 --> 00:09:11,147
Can you give me super hearing by tomorrow?

199
00:09:11,188 --> 00:09:11,820
Please?

200
00:09:11,861 --> 00:09:14,128
Big Brother, help him with Ninja Super Hearing

201
00:09:14,168 --> 00:09:15,209
Then it'll be fine, right?

202
00:09:15,249 --> 00:09:16,754
That's not a good idea

203
00:09:16,808 --> 00:09:19,291
What's this Ninja Super Hearing you're talking about?

204
00:09:19,331 --> 00:09:22,171
Ninja Super Hearing is one of the ninja arts

205
00:09:22,211 --> 00:09:26,215
It makes your hearing over ten times sharper than a normal person's

207
00:09:26,292 --> 00:09:27,222
In that case, that's awesome!

208
00:09:27,262 --> 00:09:29,357
Give me Ninja Super Hearing, hurry!

209
00:09:29,398 --> 00:09:31,689
But this Ninja Super Hearing has side effects

210
00:09:31,729 --> 00:09:32,475
Side effects?

211
00:09:32,532 --> 00:09:33,892
Just like a rabbit's nature

212
00:09:33,932 --> 00:09:35,848
Whenever you get flustered

213
00:09:35,889 --> 00:09:37,241
You'll run and jump around wildly

214
00:09:37,282 --> 00:09:39,764
Who cares if I run and jump around?

215
00:09:39,805 --> 00:09:41,774
Hattori-kun, come on, hurry!

216
00:09:41,814 --> 00:09:44,246
I really don't want to use Ninja Super Hearing on you

217
00:09:44,353 --> 00:09:47,006
Because it doesn't suit you

218
00:09:47,215 --> 00:09:50,856
Yan...

219
00:09:51,042 --> 00:09:53,368
Yan...

220
00:09:58,656 --> 00:10:00,386
How is it? What does it feel like?

221
00:10:00,426 --> 00:10:01,666
Ow, Hattori-kun!

222
00:10:01,707 --> 00:10:02,945
Why did you have to shout right in my ear?

223
00:10:02,986 --> 00:10:03,988
Great, it worked!

224
00:10:04,028 --> 00:10:06,149
Kenichi has super hearing now!

225
00:10:09,627 --> 00:10:11,088
Dad is back

226
00:10:12,309 --> 00:10:13,596
I'm home!

227
00:10:13,696 --> 00:10:14,769
Oh, you're back?

228
00:10:14,810 --> 00:10:17,103
Yeah, those cakes are for the kids

229
00:10:17,813 --> 00:10:19,675
We're going out to eat soon

230
00:10:19,747 --> 00:10:20,895
Put them in the fridge

231
00:10:20,935 --> 00:10:22,736
Give it to them tomorrow, okay?

232
00:10:23,393 --> 00:10:24,581
How could Mom do that?

233
00:10:24,621 --> 00:10:26,041
She's so stingy!

234
00:10:28,645 --> 00:10:31,126
Mom, can we eat the cake in the fridge yet?

235
00:10:31,167 --> 00:10:32,579
What are you talking about?

236
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:34,026
You don't have to play dumb

237
00:10:34,066 --> 00:10:36,705
Dad bought those cakes for us to eat!

238
00:10:36,790 --> 00:10:37,885
That's right

239
00:10:38,711 --> 00:10:41,268
Your ears are so sharp, you startled me!

240
00:10:41,309 --> 00:10:43,268
I have Ninja Super Hearing!

241
00:10:44,158 --> 00:10:45,109
When I go to school tomorrow

242
00:10:45,149 --> 00:10:47,018
I'll be able to hear what everyone's saying

243
00:10:47,071 --> 00:10:48,980
Alright then, get to bed early tonight

244
00:10:49,020 --> 00:10:49,763
See you tomorrow

245
00:10:49,803 --> 00:10:50,620
Good night

246
00:10:50,660 --> 00:10:51,456
Good night

247
00:11:10,599 --> 00:11:12,552
Oh dear...

248
00:11:28,318 --> 00:11:30,053
Ugh, I can't sleep

249
00:11:39,041 --> 00:11:40,728
Oh, what's that sound?

250
00:11:43,666 --> 00:11:45,760
Oh no, I can even hear the cockroaches

251
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:47,159
This is awful!

252
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,753
What's that sound now?

253
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:59,055
Ah, help me...

254
00:11:59,398 --> 00:12:01,108
Keep it down!

255
00:12:02,245 --> 00:12:04,437
No, keep it down!

256
00:12:04,999 --> 00:12:06,859
Hattori-kun, help!

257
00:12:08,191 --> 00:12:10,465
Hattori-kun, save me!

258
00:12:14,344 --> 00:12:16,723
I'd rather not have Super Hearing!

259
00:12:16,850 --> 00:12:18,199
That's more like it

260
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:20,790
Without that hassle, you can sleep soundly until morning

261
00:12:20,831 --> 00:12:23,193
Yan...

262
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:29,963
"Shishimaru Is a Genius Painter"

263
00:12:37,839 --> 00:12:39,559
The scenery is really gorgeous

264
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:42,592
But drawing it on paper won't be easy

265
00:12:44,497 --> 00:12:46,629
I can't do it, it's so hard to draw

266
00:12:46,669 --> 00:12:48,624
You're doing pretty well, aren't you, Kenichi?

267
00:12:48,770 --> 00:12:49,690
Really?

268
00:12:57,604 --> 00:12:58,688
What are you laughing at?

269
00:13:00,242 --> 00:13:01,694
Shishimaru, what on earth are you doing?

270
00:13:01,735 --> 00:13:03,568
Is that an alien?

271
00:13:11,045 --> 00:13:13,685
Kenichi, if you don't get up you'll be late!

272
00:13:13,935 --> 00:13:14,682
Kenichi!

273
00:13:14,723 --> 00:13:15,629
Leave me alone

274
00:13:15,669 --> 00:13:17,222
You can't sleep anymore

275
00:13:17,263 --> 00:13:19,222
No, leave me alone!

276
00:13:19,735 --> 00:13:22,160
Oh no, I'm late... I'm doomed!

277
00:13:22,267 --> 00:13:24,044
I told you to get up earlier

278
00:13:24,505 --> 00:13:25,991
I forgot to bring my drawing supplies!

279
00:13:26,031 --> 00:13:27,334
Yan...

280
00:13:27,374 --> 00:13:28,674
Huh? Oh dear...

281
00:13:28,714 --> 00:13:30,479
Which painting is Kenichi's?

282
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:32,036
Oh well, I'll just grab one

283
00:13:32,076 --> 00:13:33,726
Yan...

284
00:13:34,176 --> 00:13:36,023
Kenichi, here's your painting!

285
00:13:36,064 --> 00:13:37,530
Thanks a lot!

286
00:13:38,673 --> 00:13:41,474
Alright, I want to see how your paintings turned out

287
00:13:41,548 --> 00:13:43,274
Put them on your desks now

288
00:13:43,315 --> 00:13:44,549
-Yes, sir
-Yes, sir

289
00:13:46,535 --> 00:13:48,316
Hey, Kenichi, what's the matter?

290
00:13:48,536 --> 00:13:49,783
Nothing, sir

291
00:13:50,010 --> 00:13:50,856
Let me see

292
00:13:50,897 --> 00:13:51,753
Yes, sir

293
00:13:52,020 --> 00:13:53,435
Huh? What... this painting...

294
00:13:53,522 --> 00:13:55,023
Did... you paint this?

295
00:13:55,063 --> 00:13:56,060
Is that right, Kenichi?

296
00:13:56,101 --> 00:13:58,453
Th-This painting isn't mine

297
00:13:58,494 --> 00:13:59,891
My dog at home just doodled on it

298
00:13:59,931 --> 00:14:01,830
I just brought the wrong one

299
00:14:01,870 --> 00:14:03,407
What? A dog painted this?

300
00:14:03,854 --> 00:14:06,067
This is completely absurd!

301
00:14:06,834 --> 00:14:09,053
I wonder how the teacher will punish me this time

302
00:14:09,315 --> 00:14:10,824
Looking closer, he actually shows quite a bit of genius!

303
00:14:10,865 --> 00:14:12,756
To think he could paint something so wonderful?

304
00:14:12,796 --> 00:14:14,842
He's simply a genius painter

305
00:14:18,010 --> 00:14:19,383
It's truly breathtaking

306
00:14:19,424 --> 00:14:20,358
Frankly speaking

307
00:14:20,398 --> 00:14:22,519
we really shouldn't let this dog's talent go to waste

308
00:14:22,559 --> 00:14:23,677
He's truly incredible

309
00:14:23,759 --> 00:14:26,080
His work will shock the whole world!

310
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:28,752
What's more, if he could paint an even larger piece

311
00:14:29,002 --> 00:14:31,644
he could enter the next World Art Exhibition

312
00:14:31,724 --> 00:14:33,371
It would be... magnificent

313
00:14:33,572 --> 00:14:34,846
Now, don't you worry

314
00:14:34,886 --> 00:14:37,087
I will do everything in my power to cultivate your talent

315
00:14:37,127 --> 00:14:38,585
Yes, sir, of course

316
00:14:45,648 --> 00:14:47,209
Oh look, come see Shishimaru

317
00:14:47,249 --> 00:14:48,740
Acting like he's on top of the world

318
00:14:48,781 --> 00:14:51,133
What on earth is he holding in his mouth?

319
00:14:51,173 --> 00:14:53,582
He thinks he's puffing on a cigar

320
00:14:54,696 --> 00:14:56,959
This place is really beautiful, awesome

321
00:14:57,232 --> 00:15:00,013
He likes it here, hurry up and set up the easel

322
00:15:00,054 --> 00:15:01,353
Not right, move it over...

323
00:15:01,746 --> 00:15:02,510
Not right

324
00:15:04,207 --> 00:15:05,178
This spot looks pretty good

325
00:15:05,218 --> 00:15:07,320
Are you kidding me? Back here again?

326
00:15:09,410 --> 00:15:10,991
Not right... move it back a bit

327
00:15:11,031 --> 00:15:12,620
Huh? Back again?

328
00:15:12,660 --> 00:15:14,236
He sure is demanding

329
00:15:14,636 --> 00:15:16,354
Hey... that won't do...

330
00:15:16,394 --> 00:15:17,047
Move it forward a bit

331
00:15:17,087 --> 00:15:18,961
Forward again?

332
00:15:20,546 --> 00:15:22,556
- Ugh, he's totally messing with us
- Nothing we can do

333
00:15:22,597 --> 00:15:24,313
All for the sake of art, yan...

334
00:15:24,353 --> 00:15:25,667
Wonderful, wonderful, this spot is great!

335
00:15:25,707 --> 00:15:27,600
He looks just like a master painter

336
00:15:27,646 --> 00:15:29,486
Maybe he really is a genius painter

337
00:15:32,283 --> 00:15:34,059
Oh no, our drawing board is ruined!

338
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:34,704
Yan...

339
00:15:34,745 --> 00:15:37,019
Inspiration! Inspiration is what matters most!

340
00:15:38,335 --> 00:15:43,010
One, two, three...

341
00:15:49,946 --> 00:15:52,088
His painting is looking worse and worse

342
00:15:52,129 --> 00:15:55,348
Just scribbling randomly makes him a genius painter?

343
00:15:55,388 --> 00:15:57,629
I never believed he was a genius painter anyway

344
00:15:57,670 --> 00:15:59,555
It's just that the teacher kept praising him

345
00:16:01,008 --> 00:16:03,008
Hilarious...

346
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:07,133
Oh dear, what is that dog doing?

347
00:16:11,232 --> 00:16:12,799
Looks like we have an audience

348
00:16:13,206 --> 00:16:15,486
Wow, so fascinating...

349
00:16:15,589 --> 00:16:17,459
Why did so many people suddenly show up?

350
00:16:17,500 --> 00:16:19,550
What should we do now?

351
00:16:20,710 --> 00:16:22,591
I truly am a genius painter

352
00:16:25,415 --> 00:16:27,494
Now I'll scuttle sideways like a crab

353
00:16:27,535 --> 00:16:30,129
Scuttling sideways...

354
00:16:30,922 --> 00:16:33,790
Next, hopping like a frog, jump!

355
00:16:33,980 --> 00:16:37,774
Now I'll crawl like an earthworm...

356
00:16:38,486 --> 00:16:40,669
Next is the grand finale, don't blink, everyone!

357
00:16:40,709 --> 00:16:42,668
Shishimaru seems to have gone crazy

358
00:16:43,238 --> 00:16:46,393
Soaring into the sky!

359
00:16:46,433 --> 00:16:48,659
Wow, awesome!

360
00:16:48,965 --> 00:16:51,603
- Wow, amazing!
- Amazing, that was great to watch!

361
00:16:54,317 --> 00:16:55,434
That was truly spectacular

362
00:16:55,474 --> 00:16:56,669
I've never seen painting like that before

363
00:16:56,709 --> 00:16:58,861
Lately, a lot of people like monkey shows

364
00:16:58,902 --> 00:16:59,875
Exactly

365
00:16:59,916 --> 00:17:00,644
What?

366
00:17:00,907 --> 00:17:02,278
I'm a dog!

367
00:17:02,318 --> 00:17:03,999
Oh, so you do dog tricks?

368
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:06,114
No, I'm not doing tricks!

369
00:17:06,520 --> 00:17:07,720
To train this dog so well

370
00:17:07,760 --> 00:17:09,768
You must have put in so much work

371
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,763
Keep up the dog tricks, okay?

372
00:17:13,666 --> 00:17:16,579
-You scared me to death
-People thought Shishimaru was a street performer

373
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:20,522
Insulting me like that

374
00:17:21,201 --> 00:17:23,846
I'm so heartbroken!

375
00:17:24,321 --> 00:17:26,271
How tragic, yan...

376
00:17:29,076 --> 00:17:30,536
Oh, this painting...

377
00:17:30,576 --> 00:17:32,421
The colors and composition are beautiful

378
00:17:32,462 --> 00:17:34,291
This painting is pure genius

379
00:17:34,331 --> 00:17:37,012
I've never seen such a beautiful painting. Who painted it?

380
00:17:37,052 --> 00:17:38,054
I painted it

381
00:17:38,095 --> 00:17:39,694
Oh, so you painted it?

382
00:17:39,734 --> 00:17:41,491
You're truly full of artistic talent

383
00:17:41,558 --> 00:17:44,142
Please, I beg you, sell this painting to me

384
00:17:44,183 --> 00:17:45,096
Really?

385
00:17:45,137 --> 00:17:47,419
However, I don't have that much money on me

386
00:17:47,459 --> 00:17:49,340
Can I trade these things for it?

387
00:17:49,381 --> 00:17:50,576
Oh, you really want it?

388
00:17:50,661 --> 00:17:52,366
I'd be so grateful

389
00:17:53,759 --> 00:17:56,462
Well, that's finally over

390
00:17:57,071 --> 00:17:58,316
Is that for real?

391
00:17:58,357 --> 00:18:01,307
I really didn't expect someone would actually buy that painting

392
00:18:01,347 --> 00:18:03,211
It's true

393
00:18:03,877 --> 00:18:05,183
It's absolutely true

394
00:18:05,230 --> 00:18:07,776
I saw someone buy that painting from him with my own eyes

395
00:18:07,817 --> 00:18:09,032
From Shishimaru, right?

396
00:18:09,436 --> 00:18:10,922
So it's really true?

397
00:18:11,168 --> 00:18:12,799
Of course it's true

398
00:18:13,886 --> 00:18:16,105
I really am a genius painter now

399
00:18:16,146 --> 00:18:17,165
World-famous, too!

400
00:18:17,206 --> 00:18:18,617
-Oh dear...
-Oh dear...

401
00:18:18,658 --> 00:18:21,838
He's still so happy, completely unaware of what I went through

402
00:18:21,879 --> 00:18:23,022
Yan...
